<div class="layout">
  <div class="desk">
    <h1><a href="/">Marjorie Has Ideas</a></h1>
    <p class="tagline">Some are useful. Some are ridiculous.</p>
    <p class="tagline">A surprising number become websites.</p>
    <p class="bio">I work in pharma R&amp;D IT by day. On the side, I build small, oddly specific things — an NFL betting model that isn't very accurate but is lots of fun, a weather email service, a run tracker that shows exactly what I need to see to stay motivated.</p>

    <div class="field">
      {% for stamp in stamps %}
        {% include "stamp.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="log-panel">
    <div class="log-head">what I'm working on now</div>
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <a class="entry" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <span class="date">{{ post.date | postDate }}</span>
        <span class="title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
        <span class="teaser">{{ post.data.teaser }}</span>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
